WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:02.400
An email is waiting.

2
00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.640
You'd like a decent first draft…

3
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.260
and you'd like to stay in control.

4
00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:10.250
So before you type a single word to Copilot,

5
00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:11.850
check three things.

6
00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:12.890
The account.

7
00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:13.850
The label.

8
00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:15.870
And the data rule.

9
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.700
Every example in this course is invented.

10
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.300
Made-up New Zealand offices,

11
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.860
made-up notes, no real clients.

12
00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.980
We'll start small,

13
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.200
with one task you can check in a few minutes.

14
00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.920
First, the account.

15
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:31.560
Open Copilot for work,

16
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.280
and look at who's signed in.

17
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.120
It should be the work account your employer

18
00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.080
approved.

19
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.940
Not a personal one.

20
00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.250
Next to New Chat,

21
00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.850
look for the green shield.

22
00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:43.810
It shows that enterprise data protection applies.

23
00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:44.610
Can't see it,

24
00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:45.730
or not sure?

25
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.790
Ask IT before you go any further.

26
00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.750
Second, the label.

27
00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:53.990
Copilot isn't just one thing.

28
00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:56.710
Microsoft uses labels to show which experience

29
00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.090
you have.

30
00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:00.280
Copilot Chat, Basic,

31
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.760
is the chat included with eligible work plans,

32
00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:04.520
at no extra cost.

33
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.680
Microsoft 365 Copilot,

34
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:09.400
Basic, adds standard access inside apps like

35
00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:10.800
Word and Excel.

36
00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.720
And Premium, or Pro,

37
00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:15.880
means the paid Microsoft 365 Copilot licence,

38
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.140
with the full experience.

39
00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:22.130
So a Copilot button on its own doesn't tell

40
00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:23.010
you much.

41
00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:23.890
Read the label,

42
00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:26.050
and you'll know what your account can actually

43
00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.270
do.

44
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.390
Third, the data rule.

45
00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:32.230
With enterprise data protection,

46
00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.710
your work prompts and responses are not used

47
00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:37.130
to train the foundation models.

48
00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:39.800
But that's not the same as no record.

49
00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:42.120
Work chats can still be logged and retained,

50
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.640
for things like audits.

51
00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.120
And your team still decides what information

52
00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:47.740
you may use.

53
00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:52.220
What about a personal Microsoft account?

54
00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:54.540
Microsoft's privacy controls page shows where

55
00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:55.980
to review those choices,

56
00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.220
in Settings.

57
00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.860
Those controls are for personal Copilot.

58
00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.140
They don't make a personal account an approved

59
00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.680
work tool.

60
00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:06.827
If anything's unclear,

61
00:02:06.847 --> 00:02:09.467
take three questions to your administrator.

62
00:02:09.487 --> 00:02:12.427
Which Microsoft 365 plan do we have?

63
00:02:12.447 --> 00:02:14.667
Which Copilot licence do I have?

64
00:02:14.687 --> 00:02:17.567
And what's our rule on web search?

65
00:02:18.497 --> 00:02:19.877
Write the answers down:

66
00:02:19.897 --> 00:02:21.757
your account, your plan,

67
00:02:21.777 --> 00:02:23.597
and your Copilot label.

68
00:02:23.617 --> 00:02:24.917
If you can't find them,

69
00:02:24.937 --> 00:02:26.837
that's your question for IT.

70
00:02:26.857 --> 00:02:28.917
You don't need to buy anything to finish this

71
00:02:28.937 --> 00:02:30.297
course.

72
00:02:31.277 --> 00:02:33.177
Now pick your first task.

73
00:02:33.197 --> 00:02:34.937
A reminder, a checklist,

74
00:02:34.957 --> 00:02:36.137
or a short summary,

75
00:02:36.157 --> 00:02:37.777
from invented notes.

76
00:02:37.797 --> 00:02:39.177
Write down what you want,

77
00:02:39.197 --> 00:02:40.617
where the facts come from,

78
00:02:40.637 --> 00:02:42.797
and who'll check the result.

79
00:02:42.927 --> 00:02:45.507
For example, a reminder to a visitor about

80
00:02:45.527 --> 00:02:47.867
an appointment, with the name and the time

81
00:02:47.887 --> 00:02:49.227
left as placeholders,

82
00:02:49.247 --> 00:02:51.087
in square brackets.

83
00:02:51.217 --> 00:02:52.637
That's enough to start.

84
00:02:52.657 --> 00:02:53.917
A small task.

85
00:02:53.937 --> 00:02:55.357
A clear source.

86
00:02:55.377 --> 00:02:56.397
And a check,

87
00:02:56.417 --> 00:02:58.097
every time.
